 <h3><u>Ujjar gaya hai</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p><b><u><font size=4></font></u></b></p>
  <p><b><u><font size=4>Ujjar gaya hai</font></u></b></p>
  <b><u><font size=4> </font></u></b>
  <p><font size=4>(Shaame gharibaan) x2 jalte khaima, (yaas ka aalam) x2</font></p>
  <font size=4> <p>Koi yahaan karta tha nawha (aur koi matam) x2<br> Naade ali parhne lagi zainab (dasht mein jis dam) x2</p> <p>Haay, Fizza ne kiya marsiya ya haidare karrar</p> <p>(Ujar gaya hai zainab ka ghar baar) x3</p> 
   <ol>
    <li>Subhe daham se asr ke hangame balaa tak<br> Baiyat se chali baat to aapohnchi rida tak<br> (Zainab ko yaqeen hogaya) x2<br> Ya Haidare Karrar</li>
    <p>(Ujar gaya he zainab ka ghar baar) x3</p>
    <li>Roti rahi woh alqama aur pyaase rahe hum<br> Saadat ne paya yahaan har lamha naya gham<br> (Har zakhm par aisa laga) x2<br> Ya Haidare Karrar</li>
    <p><br> (Ujar gaya he zainab ka ghar baar) x3</p>
    <li>Kya waqt tha pardes mein aulaade nabi par<br> Khaime se jo marne chale ham shakle payambar<br> (Shabbir ne ro kar kaha) x2<br> Ya Haidare Karrar</li>
    <p>(Ujar gaya he zainab ka ghar baar) x3</p>
    <li>Is se bari ab aur kya aayegi qayaamat<br> Khud baap le kar aagaya jab bete ki mayyit<br> (Ro kar pukaari Karbala) x2<br> Ya Haidare Karrar</li>
    <p>(Ujar gaya he zainab ka ghar baar) x3</p>
    <li>Ujre nahin pardes mein yun kunba kisi ka<br> Matam huwa jab dasht mein abbase jari ka<br> (Roya alam royi wafa) x2<br> Ya Haidare Karrar</li>
    <p>(Ujar gaya he zainab ka ghar baar) x3</p>
    <li>Auno Muhammad hogaye maqtoole jafa jab<br> Beton ke laashe dekh ke ye kehti thi Zainab<br> (Lo dekhlo aakar zara) x2<br> Ya Haidare Karrar</li>
    <p><br> (Ujar gaya he zainab ka ghar baar) x3</p>
    <li>Aqa tumhaare laal pe jab chalta tha khanjar<br> Royi zameene karbala ye marsiya parh kar<br> (Ya Mustafa ya Fatima) x2<br> Ya Haidare Karrar</li>
    <p><br> (Ujar gaya he zainab ka ghar baar) x3</p>
    <li>Ab na yahaan Shabbir hai na baaqi he lashkar<br> Bas karbala ki khaak he aur aale payambar<br> (Ehle haram ki he buka) x2<br> Ya Haidare Karrar</li>
    <p><br> (Ujar gaya he zainab ka ghar baar) x3</p>
    <li>Ab Mazhar-o-Irfan ke aayi he labon par<br> Jo baat fizza ne kahi is jalti zameen par<br> (Hojaaye ye dunya fanaa) x2<br> Ya haidare karrar</li>
   </ol> <p><br> (Ujar gaya he zainab ka ghar baar) x3</p></font>
